[[File:Banshee icon.png|left]]
'''Banshees''' are a Slayer monster that require level 15 [[Slayer]] to kill. They can be found at the [[Slayer Tower]] in [[Morytania]] on the {{FloorNumber|uk=0}}, on the eastern side. Players must wear [[earmuffs]] or a [[Slayer helmet]] while fighting them in order to avoid the effects of their screams, which causes the player to take 6 damage and have their stats greatly reduced in [[Attack]], [[Strength]], [[Defence]], [[Ranged]], [[Magic]], [[Prayer]], and [[Agility]] with every attack received. There is a [[safespot]] to the north of the staircase leading to the {{FloorNumber|uk=1}}, behind the standing torch, between the staircase and wall. As banshee's attacks are [[Magical melee|magic-based]], it is advised to wear [[Armour/Ranged armour|ranged armour]] in order to minimise damage taken while fighting them. As banshees qualify as undead, the effects of the [[Salve amulet]]s and the [[Crumble Undead]] spell '''will''' work on them (note, however, that the Salve amulet and Slayer helmet effects do '''not''' stack).

Much like [[cave crawler]]s, banshees regenerate their health back quickly, gaining back 1 hitpoint every 5 ticks.

While on a banshee Slayer task, there is a 1/200 chance that a [[Screaming banshee|Screaming Banshee]] will spawn after you kill a standard banshee (if you have [[Slayer Rewards|Bigger and Badder]] unlocked). After claiming the elite tier rewards from the [[Combat Achievements]] system, this chance is increased to 1/150.

Killing a Banshee in the Slayer Tower is an easy task for the [[Morytania Diary]]. 

